## Settings / RBAC (HOT-RBAC-01)

| Route | API | Notes |
|-------|-----|-------|
| `/settings/access` | `GET/POST /api/admin/roles`, `GET/PATCH …/[code]/permissions`, `PATCH/DELETE …/[code]`, `POST /api/auth/session/refresh-permissions`, `GET /api/internal/v1/workforce/roles` | Role×permission matrix; `admin:access_manage`; system seed `ensureSystemHotelRoles`; role code+name pushed to CP catalog (ADR cp-workforce-satellite-role-catalog) |
| `/settings/users` | `GET/POST /api/admin/users`, `PATCH …/[id]` | Local logins; workforce (`cpEmploymentId`) name and password stay on provision. Position is `User.positionTitle` |
| `/settings/logins` | `GET /api/admin/user-logins?q&from&to` | Successful staff and SSO sign-ins (`UserLogin`). `q` matches login, name, or IP; `from`/`to` are Asia/Baku days (swapped if reversed) |
| `/settings/integration` | integration settings API | `?view=events` outbound, `?view=gl` revenue→GL, `?view=journal` outbound journal |
| `/settings/import` | `GET/POST /api/import*` | `api:import.elektraweb` ∩ `hotel_migration_pro` (not role-name allowlist) |
| Elektraweb bridge | `/api/integrations/elektraweb-bridge/*` | Staff: DB grant `api:integration.elektraweb_bridge` ∩ policy; S2S `role=bridge` |
| `/settings/ops-wipe` | `GET/POST /api/admin/ops-wipe` | Platform super-admin only (`PLATFORM_SUPER_ADMIN_EMAILS`); session org only, counts → confirm `WIPE`; service `ops-wipe.service.ts` (shared with CLI `scripts/ops/wipe-hotel-ops-transactional.ts`); keeps master data; audit `OpsWipe` |
| Role clone / matrix Save | `POST /api/admin/roles`, `PATCH …/permissions` | Stamp `permissionCatalogVersion` so ensure does not restore stripped Wave-1 keys |
| Staff `/login` / SSO | JWT `permissions[]`; ensure system roles + `permissionCatalogVersion`=3 (`screen:*` + `api:*`) | Hotel_Admin does **not** bypass matrix; page middleware fail-closed inventory |

